MarketAddSupplyTest
├── given onBehalf is this adapter address
│   └── it should revert
├── given assets is max uint256
│   ├── when adapter has zero token balance
│   │   └── it should revert
│   └── when adapter has token balance
│       ├── when slippage protection fails
│       │   └── it should revert
│       └── when slippage protection passes
│           └── it should add supply with adapter balance
└── given assets is not max uint256
    ├── when assets is zero
    │   └── it should proceed with zero assets
    └── when assets is greater than zero
        ├── when slippage protection fails
        │   └── it should revert
        └── when slippage protection passes
            └── it should add supply with specified assets 